After the Internet was invented and revealed first time on August 29th 1969 , Social Media Site ( SMS ) is the next most significant innovation that has partly replaced face to face communication .
SMS such as Facebook send out 700.000 messages , and 170.000 Tweets are publicized on Twitter every 60 seconds .
Unsurprisingly , the social consequences of Facebook and Twitter play an important role in communication , regardless of distance or time .
This essay will force on the benefits and disadvantages of Facebook and Twitter , and also comment on the potential future of these implications .
Communicating can be achieved , regardless of distance , through Facebook and Twitter .
The benefit of being connected globally to Facebook and Twitter is that messages can be transmitted almost instantly to viewers .
That is to say , human behaviour on Facebook is interacted we with others by sharing their mood , and receiving responses .
Finally , people are allowed to follow anyone who they find enjoyable through Twitter .
However , information which appears on Facebook or Twitter is easily accessible , therefore everybody can easily response as a public opinion .
However , information which appears on Facebook or Twitter is easily accessible , therefore everybody can easily response as a public opinion .
Mostly , Facebook users expect their friends to respond or pay attention to what they are doing .
In fact , along with agreeable and pleasant comments , there are also small amounts of aggressive and even racist comments .
First of all , people can post any racist comments which target a specific group or person .
For example , Krishna et al.(2013 ) reports a case of continuous disturbing a woman by a man called Mr .
576.e1 - 576.e2 ) .
Potentially , Facebook and Twitter , and SMS in general , may replace face - to - face communication and improve their functions , because people feel more freedom or enjoy using Facebook or Twitter without having to view each other 's appearances .
In addition , to decrease the risk of negative comments or posts , Facebook and Twitter will improve their futures to solve the less personal privacy problem .
For example , controlling what posts should be sent by adding more privacy options .
However , despite the useful of these implications , people should pay attention that Facebook and Twitter could affect their social life by avoid using them most of the time .
In contrast , because Facebook and Twitter have been connected worldwide , which means protecting personal privacy is probably impossible .
Possibly , users might express aggressive toward each other , because of lack of privacy .
